msgid "CHIP Send"
msgstr "CHIP Send"

#: includes/class-chip-affiliatewp-api.php:139
#: includes/class-chip-affiliatewp-webhooks.php:160
msgid "CHIP Send API credentials are not configured."
msgstr "Kredensial API CHIP Send tidak dikonfigurasi."

#: includes/class-chip-affiliatewp-admin.php:936
msgid ""
"CHIP Send API credentials are not set yet — payouts are disabled until they "
"are configured."
msgstr ""
"Kredensial API CHIP Send belum ditetapkan — pembayaran dilumpuhkan sehingga "
"ia dikonfigurasi."

#: includes/class-chip-affiliatewp-api.php:183
msgid "CHIP Send API error (HTTP %1$s): %2$s"
msgstr "Ralat API CHIP Send (HTTP %1$s): %2$s"

#: includes/class-chip-affiliatewp-api.php:195
msgid "CHIP Send API returned an unexpected response."
msgstr "API CHIP Send memulangkan respons yang tidak dijangka."

#: includes/class-chip-affiliatewp-admin.php:310
msgid "CHIP Send Configuration"
msgstr "Konfigurasi CHIP Send"

#: includes/class-chip-affiliatewp-admin.php:533
msgid ""
"CHIP Send delivers payout status updates to this site and every delivery is "
"verified against the webhook public key. Registration is automatic — nothing"
" to configure here."
msgstr ""
"CHIP Send menghantar kemas kini status pembayaran ke laman ini dan setiap "
"penghantaran disahkan menggunakan kunci awam webhook. Pendaftaran adalah "
"automatik — tiada apa yang perlu dikonfigurasikan di sini."

#: includes/class-chip-affiliatewp-bank-accounts.php:166
msgid "CHIP Send did not return a bank account ID."
msgstr "CHIP Send tidak memulangkan ID akaun bank."

#: includes/class-chip-affiliatewp-payouts.php:154
#: includes/class-chip-affiliatewp-payouts.php:788
msgid "CHIP Send did not return a send instruction ID."
msgstr "CHIP Send tidak memulangkan ID arahan penghantaran."

#: includes/class-chip-affiliatewp-webhooks.php:285
msgid "CHIP Send did not return a webhook ID."
msgstr "CHIP Send tidak memulangkan ID webhook."

#: includes/class-chip-affiliatewp-payouts.php:405
msgid "CHIP Send instruction %1$s. %2$s"
msgstr "Arahan penghantaran CHIP Send %1$s. %2$s"

#: includes/class-chip-affiliatewp-admin.php:776
#: includes/class-chip-affiliatewp-admin.php:788
msgid ""
"CHIP Send is in Test Mode — payouts go to the CHIP Send staging environment "
"and no real money moves."
msgstr ""
"CHIP Send dalam Mod Ujian — pembayaran pergi ke persekitaran staging CHIP "
"Send dan tiada wang sebenar dipindahkan."

#: includes/class-chip-affiliatewp-webhooks.php:156
msgid "CHIP Send payout method is not enabled."
msgstr "Kaedah pembayaran CHIP Send tidak diaktifkan."

#: includes/class-chip-affiliatewp-admin.php:777
#: includes/class-chip-affiliatewp-admin.php:789
msgid ""
"CHIP Send pays each affiliate directly to their bank account. Payouts stay "
"in Processing until CHIP confirms the transfer, then the referral is marked "
"Paid."
msgstr ""
"CHIP Send membayar setiap afiliasi terus ke akaun bank mereka. Pembayaran "
"kekal dalam status Memproses sehingga CHIP mengesahkan pemindahan, kemudian "
"rujukan ditanda Dibayar."

#: includes/class-chip-affiliatewp-admin.php:963
msgid ""
"CHIP Send webhook is not set up yet (%1$s). Payouts still work — statuses "
"are requeried hourly — but confirmations arrive faster with the webhook."
msgstr ""
"Webhook CHIP Send belum disediakan (%1$s). Pembayaran tetap berfungsi — "
"status disemak setiap jam — tetapi pengesahan lebih pantas dengan webhook."

#: includes/class-chip-affiliatewp-payouts.php:758
msgid "Commission for referral No.%d"
msgstr "Komisen untuk rujukan No.%d"

#: includes/class-chip-affiliatewp-admin.php:313
msgid ""
"Configure how CHIP Send pays affiliate commissions straight to Malaysian "
"bank accounts."
msgstr ""
"Konfigurasikan cara CHIP Send membayar komisen afiliasi terus ke akaun bank "
"Malaysia."

#: includes/class-chip-affiliatewp-admin.php:520
msgid "Connected"
msgstr "Bersambung"

#: includes/class-chip-affiliatewp-admin.php:467
#: includes/class-chip-affiliatewp-admin.php:474
msgid "Email the affiliate a CHIP receipt on every payout"
msgstr "E-mel resit CHIP kepada afiliasi bagi setiap pembayaran"

#: includes/class-chip-affiliatewp-admin.php:371
#: includes/class-chip-affiliatewp-admin.php:383
msgid "Enable CHIP Send"
msgstr "Aktifkan CHIP Send"

#: includes/class-chip-affiliatewp-admin.php:424
msgid "Enter your CHIP Send test API key"
msgstr "Masukkan kunci API ujian CHIP Send anda"

#: includes/class-chip-affiliatewp-admin.php:428
msgid "Enter your CHIP Send test secret key"
msgstr "Masukkan kunci rahsia ujian CHIP Send anda"

#: includes/class-chip-affiliatewp-admin.php:406
msgid "Enter your live CHIP Send API key"
msgstr "Masukkan kunci API CHIP Send live anda"

#: includes/class-chip-affiliatewp-admin.php:410
msgid "Enter your live CHIP Send secret key"
msgstr "Masukkan kunci rahsia CHIP Send live anda"

#: includes/class-chip-affiliatewp-admin.php:338
#: includes/class-chip-affiliatewp-admin.php:350
msgid "Let affiliates choose CHIP Send"
msgstr "Benarkan afiliasi memilih CHIP Send"

#: includes/class-chip-affiliatewp-admin.php:400
msgid "Live Credentials"
msgstr "Kelayakan Live"

#: includes/class-chip-affiliatewp-admin.php:193
msgid "Live Mode"
msgstr "Mod Live"

#: includes/class-chip-affiliatewp-webhooks.php:373
msgid "Malformed payload."
msgstr "Muatan tidak sah."

#: includes/class-chip-affiliatewp-webhooks.php:355
msgid "Missing signature."
msgstr "Tandatangan tiada."

#: includes/class-chip-affiliatewp-admin.php:439
msgid "Mode"
msgstr "Mod"

#: includes/class-chip-affiliatewp-admin.php:740
msgid "No bank details"
msgstr "Tiada butiran bank"

#: includes/class-chip-affiliatewp-webhooks.php:550
msgid "No route was found matching the URL and request method."
msgstr "Tiada laluan sepadan dengan URL dan kaedah permintaan tersebut."

#: includes/class-chip-affiliatewp-admin.php:182
msgid "Pay affiliate commissions straight to Malaysian bank accounts"
msgstr "Bayar komisen afiliasi terus ke akaun bank Malaysia"

#: includes/class-chip-affiliatewp-payouts.php:89
msgid "Payout amount must be greater than zero."
msgstr "Jumlah pembayaran mesti melebihi sifar."

#: includes/class-chip-affiliatewp-admin.php:118
msgid "Payouts go to your bank account"
msgstr "Pembayaran masuk ke akaun bank anda"

#: includes/class-chip-affiliatewp-admin.php:534
msgid ""
"Payouts still settle — statuses are requeried hourly — but confirmations "
"arrive faster with the webhook. Save your credentials to register it "
"automatically."
msgstr ""
"Pembayaran tetap diselesaikan — status disemak setiap jam — tetapi "
"pengesahan lebih pantas dengan webhook. Simpan kredensial anda untuk "
"mendaftarkannya secara automatik."

#: includes/class-chip-affiliatewp-payouts.php:641
msgid ""
"Please enable CHIP Send and add your API credentials before attempting to "
"process payments."
msgstr ""
"Sila aktifkan CHIP Send dan tambah kredensial API anda sebelum cuba "
"memproses pembayaran."

#: includes/class-chip-affiliatewp-payouts.php:78
#: includes/class-chip-affiliatewp-payouts.php:728
msgid ""
"Please enter your CHIP Send API credentials in AffiliateWP → Settings → "
"Payouts → CHIP Send before attempting to process payments."
msgstr ""
"Sila masukkan kredensial API CHIP Send anda di AffiliateWP → Tetapan → "
"Komisen → CHIP Send sebelum memproses pembayaran."

#: includes/class-chip-affiliatewp-admin.php:401
msgid "Process real payouts using your live CHIP account"
msgstr "Proses pembayaran sebenar menggunakan akaun CHIP live anda"

#: includes/class-chip-affiliatewp-admin.php:419
msgid "Process sandbox payouts with CHIP test credentials"
msgstr "Proses pembayaran sandbox dengan kelayakan ujian CHIP"

#: includes/class-chip-affiliatewp-admin.php:739
msgid "Ready"
msgstr "Sedia"

#: includes/class-chip-affiliatewp-admin.php:485
msgid "Reference Prefix"
msgstr "Awalan Rujukan"

#: includes/class-chip-affiliatewp-admin.php:409
msgid "Secret Key"
msgstr "Kunci Rahsia"

#: includes/class-chip-affiliatewp-webhooks.php:367
msgid "Signature verification failed."
msgstr "Pengesahan tandatangan gagal."

#: includes/class-chip-affiliatewp-admin.php:423
msgid "Test API Key"
msgstr "Kunci API Ujian"

#: includes/class-chip-affiliatewp-admin.php:418
msgid "Test Credentials"
msgstr "Kelayakan Ujian"

#: includes/class-chip-affiliatewp-admin.php:192
#: includes/class-chip-affiliatewp-admin.php:449
#: includes/class-chip-affiliatewp-admin.php:456
msgid "Test Mode"
msgstr "Mod Ujian"

#: includes/class-chip-affiliatewp-admin.php:442
msgid ""
"Test Mode routes every payout through CHIP test credentials and never moves "
"real money."
msgstr ""
"Mod Ujian menghantar setiap pembayaran melalui kelayakan ujian CHIP dan "
"tidak sekali-kali memindahkan wang sebenar."

#: includes/class-chip-affiliatewp-admin.php:427
msgid "Test Secret Key"
msgstr "Kunci Rahsia Ujian"

#: includes/class-chip-affiliatewp-webhooks.php:361
msgid "The configured webhook public key is not valid."
msgstr "Kunci awam webhook yang dikonfigurasi tidak sah."

#: includes/class-chip-affiliatewp-webhooks.php:396
msgid "The payload is missing a send instruction ID or state."
msgstr "Muatan tiada ID atau keadaan arahan penghantaran (send instruction)."

#: includes/class-chip-affiliatewp-payouts.php:818
msgid ""
"The payout record could not be created. The referral may already have an "
"active payout."
msgstr ""
"Rekod pembayaran tidak dapat dicipta. Rujukan ini mungkin sudah mempunyai "
"pembayaran aktif."

#: includes/class-chip-affiliatewp-payouts.php:70
msgid "The specified payout does not exist."
msgstr "Pembayaran yang dinyatakan tidak wujud."

#: includes/class-chip-affiliatewp-payouts.php:712
msgid "The specified referral does not exist."
msgstr "Rujukan yang dinyatakan tidak wujud."

#: includes/class-chip-affiliatewp-webhooks.php:127
msgid ""
"The webhook URL (%1$s) is not reachable: %2$s. The webhook was not "
"registered — fix site reachability or configure payouts without webhooks "
"(the hourly requery sweep still works)."
msgstr ""
"URL webhook (%1$s) tidak dapat dicapai: %2$s. Webhook tidak didaftarkan — "
"baiki kebolehcapaian laman atau konfigurasi pembayaran tanpa webhook (sapuan"
" requery setiap jam tetap berfungsi)."

#: includes/class-chip-affiliatewp-webhooks.php:106
msgid "The webhook URL is not publicly reachable from this site."
msgstr "URL webhook tidak dapat dicapai secara awam dari laman ini."

#: includes/class-chip-affiliatewp-payouts.php:724
msgid "There is no affiliate connected to this referral."
msgstr "Tiada afiliasi dikaitkan dengan rujukan ini."

#: includes/class-chip-affiliatewp-payouts.php:751
msgid "This affiliate account does not have a payment email."
msgstr "Akaun afiliasi ini tiada e-mel pembayaran."

#: includes/class-chip-affiliatewp-admin.php:745
msgid "This affiliate has bank details on file and can be paid via CHIP Send."
msgstr ""
"Afiliasi ini mempunyai butiran bank disimpan dan boleh dibayar melalui CHIP "
"Send."

#: includes/class-chip-affiliatewp-bank-accounts.php:147
msgid "This affiliate has no bank account details on file."
msgstr "Afiliasi ini tiada butiran akaun bank disimpan."

#: includes/class-chip-affiliatewp-admin.php:746
msgid ""
"This affiliate has no bank code or account number on file, so a CHIP Send "
"payout would fail."
msgstr ""
"Afiliasi ini tiada kod bank atau nombor akaun disimpan, jadi pembayaran CHIP"
" Send akan gagal."

#: includes/class-chip-affiliatewp-payouts.php:111
msgid "This affiliate has no payment email on file."
msgstr "Afiliasi ini tiada e-mel pembayaran disimpan."

#: includes/class-chip-affiliatewp-payouts.php:74
msgid "This payout is not a CHIP Send payout."
msgstr "Pembayaran ini bukan pembayaran CHIP Send."

#: includes/class-chip-affiliatewp-payouts.php:720
msgid ""
"This referral is already attached to a payout. Resolve that payout to pay it"
" again."
msgstr ""
"Rujukan ini telah dikaitkan dengan pembayaran. Selesaikan pembayaran "
"tersebut untuk membayarnya semula."

#: includes/class-chip-affiliatewp-admin.php:500
msgid "Two characters used to prefix CHIP Send references."
msgstr "Dua aksara yang digunakan sebagai awalan rujukan CHIP Send."

#: includes/class-chip-affiliatewp-admin.php:517
msgid "Webhook"
msgstr "Webhook"

#: includes/class-chip-affiliatewp-admin.php:530
msgid "Webhook connected"
msgstr "Webhook bersambung"

#: includes/class-chip-affiliatewp-admin.php:531
msgid "Webhook not set up yet"
msgstr "Webhook belum disediakan"

#: includes/class-chip-affiliatewp-webhooks.php:351
msgid "Webhook signature verification is not configured yet."
msgstr "Pengesahan tandatangan webhook belum dikonfigurasi."

#: includes/class-chip-affiliatewp-admin.php:374
msgid ""
"When off, CHIP Send is hidden from affiliates and no payouts are submitted "
"to CHIP."
msgstr ""
"Apabila dimatikan, CHIP Send disembunyikan daripada afiliasi dan tiada "
"pembayaran dihantar ke CHIP."

#: includes/class-chip-affiliatewp-payouts.php:637
msgid "You do not have permission to process payouts."
msgstr "Anda tiada kebenaran untuk memproses pembayaran."

#: includes/class-chip-affiliatewp-admin.php:113
msgid ""
"Your commissions are paid straight to your Malaysian bank account. Add your "
"bank account details in your payout settings so we can send your next "
"payout."
msgstr ""
"Komisen anda dibayar terus ke akaun bank Malaysia anda. Tambah butiran akaun"
" bank dalam tetapan pembayaran anda supaya kami boleh menghantar pembayaran "
"seterusnya."

#: includes/class-chip-affiliatewp-admin.php:121
msgid ""
"Your commissions are sent to %1$s %2$s. Bank account verification can take a"
" little while; you will be paid as soon as it completes."
msgstr ""
"Komisen anda dihantar ke %1$s %2$s. Pengesahan akaun bank mungkin mengambil "
"masa; anda akan dibayar sebaik sahaja ia selesai."

